      "short_description": "3CHEM Corporation is a manufacturer of advanced coating systems tailored for the aerospace and military industries. With over 60 years of experience, the company specializes in high-solid and low VOC coatings, including interior and exterior coatings, epoxy primers, anti-skid coatings, and specialty coatings. Headquartered in Miramar, Florida, 3CHEM also has facilities in Oklahoma City and operates internationally in Colombia, Mexico, and India.\n\nThe company is committed to research and development, focusing on composite surface protection and zero VOC coatings. 3CHEM offers custom formulation services, digital color tools, and technical assistance to meet specific customer needs. It is ISO 9001 and AS9100 certified and is recognized as a Hispanic American-owned, minority-owned, and small disadvantaged business. 3CHEM serves a global clientele, including airlines and original equipment manufacturers in the aerospace sector.",
